DESCRIPTION:BEKSCITY RUN CLUB — Social Run\nCategory: Monthly Signature Event\nDistrict: ALL DISTRICTS\nMeeting Point: OOPL\nVenue: OOPL (Olusegun Obasanjo Presidential Library grounds)\nDistance: 5 km\nRoute Stops: Standard scenic loop\nSponsor: Breakfast Club\n\nPLANNED ACTIVITIES:\nMorning community run\, recovery stretching\, and breakfast social time.\n\nABOUT THIS RUN:\nSaturday morning social run gathering at OOPL. Run followed by breakfast and social bonding courtesy of the Breakfast Club.\n\nSTANDARD SCHEDULE:\n• 06:45 AM — Check-in and gathering\n• 07:00 AM — Warm-up session\n• 07:15 AM — Group run departs\n• 08:15 AM — Cooldown & stretching\n• 08:30 AM — Refreshments & community social\n\nBEKSCITY RUN CLUB | Keep Moving Forward
